            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Time to completion can vary based on your schedule, but most learners are able to complete the Specialization in about 8 months."
            },
            "name": "How long does it take to complete the Machine Learning Specialization?"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Each course in the Specialization is offered on a regular schedule, with sessions starting about once per month. If you don&#x27;t complete a course on the first try, you can easily transfer to the next session, and your completed work and grades will carry over."
            },
            "name": "How often is each course in the Specialization offered?"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "You should have some experience with computer programming; most assignments in this Specialization will use the Python programming language. This Specialization is designed specifically for scientists and software developers who want to expand their skills into data science and machine learning, but is appropriate for anyone with basic math and programming skills and an interest in deriving intelligence from data."
            },
            "name": "What background knowledge is necessary?"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "We recommend taking the courses in the order presented, as each subsequent course will build on material from previous courses."
            },
            "name": "Do I have to take the courses in this Specialization in a specific order?"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Coursera courses and certificates don&#x27;t carry university credit, though some universities may choose to accept Specialization Certificates for credit. Check with your institution to learn more."
            },
            "name": "Will I earn university credit for completing the Machine Learning Specialization?"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "You will be able to use machine learning techniques to solve complex real-world problems, by identifying the right method for your task, implementing an algorithm, assessing and improving the algorithm’s performance, and deploying your solution as a service."
